{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arachnaut is a side scrolling offline 2D platformer with music at its core.\u00a0Dripping with style, Arachnaut will have you collecting power-ups, avoiding obstacles and hazards, upgrading your abilities, unlocking game modes, completing achievements, and even buying some hats!<br><br> Key features:<br>- Fast paced side scroller<br>- Powerups<br>- Achievements<br>- Pendulum physics for web swinging<br>- Collision with obstacles and hazards<br>- Different game modes<br>- Upgrade shop<br>- Cosmetic items<br><br>Play casually to beat your high scores or try to attain all achievements!\u00a0Run, swing, and jump alongside Captain Phidippus in a never-ending cosmic odyssey.  <br><br>Turns out spiders can be astronauts too...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968380?t=1756835652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968380/074aa8a644b67a854455a5fdc16f2d6818c09a4a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756835652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968380/98ca409458e318e6939961b1879fe6e204d5e174/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756835652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968380/98ca409458e318e6939961b1879fe6e204d5e174/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756835652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arachnaut is a side scrolling offline 2D platformer with music at its core.\u00a0Dripping with style, Arachnaut will have you collecting power-ups, avoiding obstacles and hazards, upgrading your abilities, unlocking game modes, completing achievements, and even buying some hats!<br><br> Key features:<br>- Fast paced side scroller<br>- Powerups<br>- Achievements<br>- Pendulum physics for web swinging<br>- Collision with ob